    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f9db7cad866a48b581b897c0f0cdef8b",
      "statement": "Journal detection is purely geometric: legacy/journaled uses inode_table_block >= 36 (JOURNAL_INODE_TABLE_BLOCK); v3 uses has_journal_layout() checking inode_table_block == data_bitmap_block + data_bitmap_blocks() + JOURNAL_RESERVED_BLOCKS (33 blocks). The SuperBlock struct is unchanged between journaled and non-journaled images.",
