      "id": "claim_b0bf0232fcac4c1c90895d5b996f52cf",
      "statement": "Encryption scheme versions: 0 = unencrypted, 1 = ENCRYPTION_SCHEME_LEGACY (XChaCha20-Poly1305 without AAD), 2 = ENCRYPTION_SCHEME_CONTEXT_BOUND (XChaCha20-Poly1305 with AAD binding ciphertext to inode ID, chunk index, and flags via domain separator OIFS-AAD-v1). Validation requires encryption_version in {1,2} when encrypted=true, and 0 when encrypted=false.",
